[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 4327.189, "timestamp": "01:12:07", "text": "しかし、彼女はそこにいるべきだ。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4337.669, "timestamp": "01:12:17", "text": "恐怖を掻き立てる別の探求が、それを凌駕するのだろうか？   よくわから"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4341.03, "timestamp": "01:12:21", "text": "ない。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4351.03, "timestamp": "01:12:31", "text": "こんにちは、レベッカ。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4359.83, "timestamp": "01:12:39", "text": "彼らとは話すことすらできない。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4363.43, "timestamp": "01:12:43", "text": "ええ、ゲーム"}]